  "claim_ceiling": "Synthetic EVSI results qualify only the declared priors, likelihoods, loss functions, sensor action set and evaluator. They do not prove sensor accuracy, physical asset condition, structural adequacy, geotechnical or electrical safety, mine safety, productivity or authority to intervene.",
